{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/programming' data-target='computer\/programming' data-title='Programming'>\r\n\t\t\tProgramming\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/programming\/google_api' data-target='computer\/programming\/google_api' data-title='Google API'>\r\n\t\t\tGoogle API\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Working notes on Places.","label":"Places","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/programming\/google_api\/gcm","label":"GCM","url":"\/computer\/programming\/google_api\/gcm"},"nextArticle":null,"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\tWorking notes on Places.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<strong>Source.<\/strong> Https:\/\/developers.google.com\/places\/android-api\/usage.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\thttps:\/\/developers.google.com\/places\/android-api\/usage#request-uplift\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Place Type<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\thttps:\/\/developers.google.com\/android\/reference\/com\/google\/android\/gms\/location\/places\/Place\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tInt Var Value.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\thttps:\/\/developers.google.com\/places\/supported_types#table1\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tPer app (not app instance).\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Base<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\t1 000 requests per 24 hour period.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Billing<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\t150 000.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Post<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tUplift.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Place picker.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Add place.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<p>\n\t\tIf the number of requests exceeds 500 000 per 24 hour period on a regular basis, we consider your app a significant user of the Google Places API for Android. We will be in touch to chat about planning capacity. You don't need to take any action until we contact you.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\thttps:\/\/developers.google.com\/android-publisher\/quotas?hl=en\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tFor the purpose of enforcing this quota, the day ends at midnight Pacific time (UTC-8 when California is on standard time, UTC-7 when California is on daylight time).\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tAndroid signup.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\thttps:\/\/developers.google.com\/places\/android-api\/signup\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCert + Package name combination.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<a\r\n\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/programming\/google_api\/places\/notes' data-target='computer\/programming\/google_api\/places\/notes' data-title='Notes'>\r\n<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible item_block_image_contain' src='\/computer\/programming\/google_api\/places\/notes.svg' loading='lazy' alt=\"Navigation - link to computer\/programming\/google_api\/places\/notes\"><div class='item_block_text'><div>Notes<\/div><\/div><\/a><\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/programming\/google_api\/places\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/programming\/google_api\/places\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL ite